                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2d4bf39-c0ae-47c1-8a9d-1b76d4f6333e",
                                "sense_id": "9cad3f1b-c125-3c57-9ea9-f8b64a932c59",
                                "text": "Иу́душка та́к-таки не дал Пе́теньке де́нег, хотя́, как до́брый оте́ц, приказа́л в мину́ту отъе́зда положи́ть ему́ в пово́зку и ку́рочки, и теля́тинки, и пирожо́к.",
                                "translation": "So Judas did not after all give Petenka the money, although at the moment of departure he did, as a good father, give instructions for chicken, veal, and a pie to be stowed in the kibitka.",
                                "english": "So Judas did not after all give Petenka the money, although at the moment of departure he did, as a good father, give instructions for chicken, veal, and a pie to be stowed in the kibitka."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
